---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pricing" description="Chudware subscription plans: a 14-day trial, native Desktop, Studio with hosted browser access, education pricing, and organization deployment.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
      <h1>Choose native desktop or desktop plus browser access.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Subscriptions are monthly per account. Both paid plans include the same engineering workspaces; Studio adds the hosted browser workspace and a larger storage quota. Eligible verified <strong>.edu</strong> accounts see the education rate at checkout.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap access-grid">
      <article class="access-option">
        <p class="eyebrow">Trial</p>
        <h2>Evaluate the complete product for 14 days.</h2>
        <p class="price"><span class="price-amount">$0</span> <span class="price-period">for 14 days after email verification</span></p>
        <ul class="fact-list"><li>Browser workspace and native desktop app</li><li>5 GB of account storage</li><li>Modeling, assemblies, CAM, PLM, simulation, reverse engineering, and copilot</li><li>No payment card required</li></ul>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://app.chudware.com/signup">Start a trial</a>
      </article>
      <article class="access-option access-primary">
        <p class="eyebrow">Desktop</p>
        <h2>Run Chudware on your workstation.</h2>
        <p class="price"><span class="price-amount">Monthly</span> <span class="price-period">current rate confirmed at checkout</span></p>
        <ul class="fact-list"><li>Native Windows, Linux, and macOS application</li><li>Per-account licence with self-service device revocation</li><li>5 GB of account storage</li><li>Eligible verified .edu accounts see the education rate at checkout</li><li>Cancel at the end of the current billing period</li></ul>
        <a class="button" href="https://app.chudware.com/signup">Choose Desktop</a>
      </article>
      <article class="access-option access-primary">
        <p class="eyebrow">Studio</p>
        <h2>Add the hosted browser workspace.</h2>
        <p class="price"><span class="price-amount">Monthly</span> <span class="price-period">current rate confirmed at checkout</span></p>
        <ul class="fact-list"><li>Everything in Desktop</li><li>Hosted browser workspace with no local installation</li><li>100 GB of account storage</li><li>Eligible verified .edu accounts see the education rate at checkout</li><li>Access from any supported desktop browser</li></ul>
        <a class="button" href="https://app.chudware.com/signup">Choose Studio</a>
      </article>
      <article class="access-option">
        <p class="eyebrow">AI provider</p>
        <h2>Use your own provider account or API key.</h2>
        <p>The copilot uses a provider connection you configure. Provider subscriptions, usage limits, and API charges remain between you and that provider.</p>
        <ul class="fact-list"><li>Connect a supported provider account or enter an API key in Provider settings</li><li>Never paste provider credentials into chat or a project note</li><li>Chudware does not currently sell AI token packs or managed model capacity</li></ul>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/docs/ai-copilot/">Configure the copilot</a>
      </article>
      <article class="access-option access-contact">
        <p class="eyebrow">Enterprise</p>
        <h2>Organization deployment and billing.</h2>
        <p>Enterprise accounts include the desktop and browser workspaces, a 1 TB storage quota, and organization billing. Contact Chudware for deployment and access requirements.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="mailto:sales@chudware.com">Contact sales <Icon name="arrow-right" /></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section pricing-principles">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Billing</p>
        <h2>Subscriptions are managed from your account.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Stripe processes card payments. Use the billing section of your account to change plan, update a payment method, download invoices, or cancel. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the period already paid for.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="pricing-note">
        <p class="eyebrow">Terms at a glance</p>
        <p>Prices are in US dollars and exclude taxes Stripe must collect for your location.</p>
        <p>Eligible verified <code>.edu</code> accounts see the education rate in authenticated checkout.</p>
        <p>Licensing is per account. Desktop device entitlements can be revoked from that account and are not transferable. See the <a class="text-link" href="/legal/eula/">EULA</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="wrap section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Get started</p>
      <h2>Use the trial before choosing a plan.</h2>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://app.chudware.com/signup">Create an account</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/download/">Download the desktop app</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
